{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～～～～～！ななせまる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/23/2807638/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣じゃ(　・´ｰ・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「涙がまだ悲しみだった頃」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしめっちゃ好きです。いつも頭の中で歌ってます(　・´ｰ・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって、ダンスも曲も歌詞も好み！わしの好み！mvをみても皆がこの曲をレッスンしてても鳥肌がたつよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"故に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの前でのパフォーマンスが待ち遠しいですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーガールズの曲のときは、わたしはいつも裏で小さく踊ってます。緊張をほぐしがてら！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"33人個人pv 今回は「ぶらり旅」です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさに行きたかった、旅！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしは何処にいったでしょうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャンプに参加できなかったのは、実はこのためでした。はは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(まぁ夕飯作りから参加はしてます)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人pvの事は、また公開されてから話をしようー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/23/2807638/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むぎ太くん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーもう暑くなってもうた...日焼けせんようにせなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バイッッッ"}],"source":"archive"}